;; The expressions' types and the names' members reimplement, for the native trees, jdk26u
;; (https://github.com/openjdk/jdk26u at baf63fbe42b8758448fee570a9d9bb914272d259)'s
;; src/jdk.compiler/share/classes/com/sun/tools/javac/comp/Attr.java (visitIdent, visitSelect and
;; selectSym, checkIdInternal, visitApply and adjustMethodReturnType, checkMethod's unchecked
;; erasure, visitIndexed, visitParens, visitAssign, visitAssignop, visitUnary, visitBinary,
;; visitTypeCast, visitTypeTest, visitConditional and isBooleanOrNumeric, visitNewClass's and
;; visitNewArray's types, visitLiteral; visitApply's and visitNewClass's resolution sites: the
;; site, select super, the anonymous class's superclass constructor), ArgumentAttr.java (which
;; arguments are standalone) and Operators.java (resolveUnary, resolveBinary: the operator helpers'
;; tests and lookups, stringPromotion); and, the inference tier's (JN9d), Attr.java's checkMethod
;; instantiation, visitLambda, getTargetInfo, lambdaBodyResult, checkLambdaCompatible, visitReference,
;; checkReferenceCompatible, visitNewClass's diamonds and qualified creations, visitRecordPattern,
;; visitBindingPattern, visitTypeUnion, visitForeachLoop's element and condType's lub, ArgumentAttr.java's
;; argument types, DeferredAttr.java's stuck policies, StructuralStuckChecker and deferred nodes,
;; Infer.java's instantiateFunctionalInterface and instantiatePolymorphicSignatureInstance,
;; Resolve.java's findPolymorphicSignatureInstance, Check.java's localClassName and checkLocalVarType and
;; TreeInfo.java's isExpressionStatement, whose notice follows (LICENSE.md, "OpenJDK (jdk26u)"):
;;
;; Copyright (c) 1999, 2025, Oracle and/or its affiliates. All rights reserved.
;; DO NOT ALTER OR REMOVE COPYRIGHT NOTICES OR THIS FILE HEADER.
